[[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a>\n                                           (Right side).</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a>\n                                           (Right\nside).</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237642\">1092A12</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237490\">1032B14</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237645\">1092G14</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237647\">1092G20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Working via the wheel arch, undo the bolt\nfixing the alternator spacer to the right cylinder head timing belt rear\ncover.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) for the driven pullies for the left and right\ncylinder heads using the tool (1b) for counter-torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.822.146.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013844.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Remove the driven pullies (1a) for the left and right cylinder\nheads using the tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.954.001</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013845.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the timing belt fixed tensioners\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013846.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the rear timing gear covers (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013847.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the water pump pulley (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013848.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the water pump cover.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013849.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the water pump (1b) complete with\ngasket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013850.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the water pump (1a), complete with gasket, back in its\nhousing and secure it tightening the bolts (1b) to the recommended\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT PUMP</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.7 ÷ 0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013851.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>Tighten the water pump cover fixing bolts.</p><p>Place the water pump drive pulley back\nin its housing and secure it tightening the bolts to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT PUMP PULLEY</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Water pump side) 0.7 ÷ 0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Place the side timing drive belt rear covers\nback in their housings and secure them using the bolts.</p><p>1. Place the timing belt fixed tensioners (1a) back in their housings\nand secure them tightening the bolts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>FIXED TENSIONER</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.7 ÷ 2.1</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013852.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<p>Place the left and right cylinder head\ndriven pullies back in their housings and secure them without tightening\nthe bolts.</p><p>Tighten the bolt fixing the alternator\nfront spacer to the right cylinder head timing belt rear cover.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237647\">1092G20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237645\">1092G14</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237490\">1032B14</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237461\">1016A42</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237557\">1072B50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238399\">5510C14</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237460\">1016A36</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237460\">1016A36</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238399\">5510C14</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237557\">1072B50</a>\n                                  